@startuml
actor Op as "Оператор"
participant MES_FE as "MES Frontend (React)"
participant MES_BE as "MES Backend (C#)"
database MES_DB as "MES DB"
database Cache as "Кеш (Redis)"

Op -> MES_FE: "Взять заказ в работу"\n(order_id=O-123)
MES_FE -> MES_BE: POST /orders/O-123/status\n{ new_status: MANUFACTURING_STARTED }
MES_BE -> MES_DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED\nWHERE id=O-123
MES_DB --> MES_BE: OK

note over MES_BE
Инвалидация кеша списков
по старому и новому статусу
end note

MES_BE -> Cache: DEL orders:PRICE_CALCULATED:page=1
MES_BE -> Cache: DEL orders:MANUFACTURING_STARTED:page=1
MES_BE --> MES_FE: 200 OK
MES_FE --> Op: Статус обновлён

Op -> MES_FE: Обновить дашборд
MES_FE -> MES_BE: GET /orders?status=PRICE_CALCULATED
MES_BE -> Cache: GET orders:PRICE_CALCULATED:page=1
Cache --> MES_BE: MISS
MES_BE -> MES_DB: SELECT * FROM orders\nWHERE status=PRICE_CALCULATED\nORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT ...
MES_DB --> MES_BE: новый список
MES_BE -> Cache: SET orders:PRICE_CALCULATED:page=1\nTTL=30-60 сек
MES_BE --> MES_FE: новый список
MES_FE --> Op: Показать обновлённый список
@enduml
